OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Flinger through the evening then ease
OL,7,Fovernight as cloud breaks, bringing
OL,8,Fsome clearer spells in places. Winds
OL,9,Fturning very light which may lead to
OL,10,Fmist and fog forming in valleys and
OL,11,Fprone rural locations.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FEarly mist and fog will lift
OL,14,Fleaving bright and sunny spells during
OL,15,Fthe morning. Patchy cloud moves in
OL,16,Flater, but staying dry. Light winds
OL,17,Fand feeling mild in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
