OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled with sunny spells throughout.
OL,7,FLight winds leading to mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches overnight, slow to clear each
OL,9,Fday. Cloudier skies arriving from the
OL,10,Fnorth on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
